I really like the art style, but the actual characters / interactions / 
everything that isn't the art I don't like at all. We have enough learning 
materials by now and a learning comic is a bit condescending IMO. I feel as 
though we would benefit as a community from having a simple-language 
lojban-only comic. Keep the grammar simple at first and gradually get 
natural as the comic goes on. So far the rude / verbose teacher is enough 
to put me off from ever reading this. I think the idea is completely 
fantastic, though. If you want some help, we have at least two or three 
people sitting around that want to do some kind of comic project, myself 
included. As a suggestion, I would replace the rude teacher with a more 
funny / strange character (Great Teacher Onizuka for example).

